  ('Hospitality, culture and corporate', ['Abu Dhabi&rsquo;s video needs are shaped by its strengths: resorts on Saadiyat and Yas, a growing cultural district, corporate headquarters on Al Maryah Island, and new residential communities. I&rsquo;ve shot hospitality content for Marriott and bring that experience to Abu Dhabi hotels, restaurants and attractions, along with corporate and property work.']),
  ('What I shoot in Abu Dhabi', ['<strong>Hotel and resort films</strong>: rooms, dining, spa and experience reels. <strong>Corporate video</strong> for ADGM and Al Maryah Island firms. <strong>Real estate</strong>: walkthroughs and lifestyle films for Al Reem, Saadiyat, Yas and Al Raha. <strong>Events</strong>: launches and conferences. <strong>Social content</strong>: reels and short-form series.']),
