C['photographer-bangalore.html'] = dict(city='Bangalore', **IN, region='IN-KA', kind='photo', hub='photography.html', cityhub='/india/',
 title='Photographer in Bangalore | Brand, Product & Events',
 desc='Professional photographer in Bangalore for brands, products, food, events, fashion and portraits. 8 years of experience, Sony A7 IV, prime lenses.',
 h1='Photographer', h1em='in Bangalore', imgs='photo',
 sections=[
  ('A photographer for Bangalore brands', ['Bangalore is one of my two working bases, alongside Dubai. The city&rsquo;s photography needs are different from most: tech and startup teams needing professional portraits and office culture shots, D2C brands needing product and e-commerce images, a thriving food and brewery scene, fashion labels and designers, and a busy event calendar. I shoot all of it with the same 8 years of experience I&rsquo;ve brought to Vaseline (Unilever), Marriott and Cindrebay School of Design.']),
  ('What I photograph in Bangalore', ['<strong>Product and e-commerce</strong>: catalogue images to marketplace specs plus lifestyle frames. <strong>Food and restaurants</strong> in Indiranagar, Koramangala and HSR. <strong>Corporate and team portraits</strong> for Whitefield, Outer Ring Road and MG Road offices. <strong>Events</strong>: conferences, launches and parties. <strong>Fashion</strong>: see fashion photographer in Bangalore. <strong>Weddings</strong>: see wedding photographer in Bangalore.']),
  ('The Bangalore advantage', ['Bangalore&rsquo;s mild climate and soft overcast light are kind to outdoor shoots for much of the year, and the city has plenty of character locations: Cubbon Park, old bungalows in Basavanagudi and Malleshwaram, and modern glass offices. I scout locations to match the brief rather than defaulting to a studio.'])],
 faqs=[('Do you have a studio in Bangalore?','I shoot on location or at rented studios depending on the brief; small product shoots can happen at your office.'),
  ('Do you shoot corporate headshots in Bangalore?','Yes, individually or for whole teams on a single day.'),
  ('Can you do photo and video together?','Yes. See videographer in Bangalore.'),
  ('How do I get a quote?','Share the brief and number of images or products; you&rsquo;ll get a fixed price.')],
 blog='blog/brand-video-cost-bangalore.html')
